    <Box style={{ position: 'relative', zIndex: 1, width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: '94px 56px 76px 56px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26.5, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>现实痛点与范式转换：复用成品客户端生态，打破单窗封闭与刚性代码</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.8, color: '#6B7280', marginTop: 5 }}>自家应用享最高缓存率与低价补贴，但封闭难拓展 ｜ 底层代码框架什么都要手写 ｜ 双颗粒度 Trace 与 MD 渐进编排</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, height: 404 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 430, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ background: '#F5F7FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: '9px 12px', borderLeft: '3.5px solid #9D0A12', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.8, color: '#9D0A12', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>痛点 A：各家成品享最高缓存率但封闭，反代违规丢功能</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.6, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.30 }}>各家对自家应用(如 Claude Desktop/Code)给最高缓存率与低价</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.6, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.30 }}>最大缺点是生态封闭、可拓展性差，会话锁在单窗口</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.6, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.30 }}>拆凭证逆向反代既违规封号，又丢掉原厂高缓存与工具链</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ background: '#F5F7FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: '9px 12px', borderLeft: '3.5px solid #073E87', flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.8, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>痛点 B：底层代码框架什么都要手写 vs MD 渐进编排</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.6, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.30 }}>LangGraph、AutoGen 只给空架子，工具与沙箱全靠手写</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.6, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.30 }}>Python 写死 DAG 状态机改流程慢，我们直接复用成品宿主</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.6, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.30 }}>用 CLAUDE.md、TASK.md 定契约，随时用自然语言重构角色</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ background: '#F5F7FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: '9px 12px', borderLeft: '3.5px solid #9D0A12', flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.8, color: '#9D0A12', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>痛点 C：单层流水账难看懂 vs 双颗粒度 Trace 回路</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.6, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.30 }}>通用追踪仅记细粒度调用流水账，看不出为什么这么选</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.6, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.30 }}>双颗粒度 Trace：粗粒度决策段(turn+steps)锚定细粒度步</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.6, color: '#1F2937', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.30 }}>配合四件套指针交接、轮内挂起审批与异构独立验收</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 726, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 118, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
