    </Box>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1.5px solid #073E87', borderRadius: 6, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 25, background: '#073E87', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 82, padding: '4px 6px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.0, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>核心维度</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 298, padding: '4px 7px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.8, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>底层代码框架 (什么都要手写) 与 闭源成品 (封闭难拓展)</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '4px 7px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.8, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>本系统设计 (官方协议 + CDP + 适配器 · MD 渐进编排 · 双颗粒度 Trace)</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 82, padding: '4px 6px', background: '#F8FAFC', borderRight: '1px solid #E5E7EB', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.0, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>1. 开发编排</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 298, padding: '4px 7px', background: '#FFFBFB', borderRight: '1px solid #E5E7EB', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.3, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.25 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9D0A12' }}>底层框架什么都要手写 + DAG 写死</span>：只调裸模型 API，补丁/沙箱/记忆全靠手写，改流程需改 Python 代码</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '4px 7px', background: '#F8FBFF', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.4, color: '#1F2937', lineHeight: 1.25 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>复用 7 大可驱动宿主 + MD 渐进编排</span>：免造底层轮子；用 CLAUDE.md、TASK.md 自然语言随时重构角色与拓扑</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 82, padding: '4px 6px', background: '#F8FAFC', borderRight: '1px solid #E5E7EB', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.0, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2. 决策还原</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 298, padding: '4px 7px', background: '#FFFBFB', borderRight: '1px solid #E5E7EB', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.3, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.25 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9D0A12' }}>单层调用流水账 + 生态黑盒</span>：通用遥测仅记细粒度 API 进出文本，满屏步骤看不出「当时为什么这么选」</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '4px 7px', background: '#F8FBFF', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.4, color: '#1F2937', lineHeight: 1.25 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>双颗粒度 Trace（粗粒度决策段 + 细粒度步）</span>：粗粒度决策段(触发/备选/选择/理由)经 turn+steps 锚定在 9 家细粒度轮/步证据上</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 82, padding: '4px 6px', background: '#F8FAFC', borderRight: '1px solid #E5E7EB', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.0, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3. 生态拓展</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 298, padding: '4px 7px', background: '#FFFBFB', borderRight: '1px solid #E5E7EB', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.3, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.25 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9D0A12' }}>各家产品封闭、可拓展性差</span>：虽有自家最高缓存命中率、低价补贴与子代理(12/84)，但跨产品无宿主</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '4px 7px', background: '#F8FBFF', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.4, color: '#1F2937', lineHeight: 1.25 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>按五级尺度分清宿主归属（532 格对账）</span>：小尺度复用原厂最高缓存率与低价优化；双会话(58/84)与群会话(31/35)由中心当宿主</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 82, padding: '4px 6px', background: '#F8FAFC', borderRight: '1px solid #E5E7EB', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.0, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>4. 漂移监控</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 298, padding: '4px 7px', background: '#FFFBFB', borderRight: '1px solid #E5E7EB', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.3, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.25 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9D0A12' }}>长程多轮目标漂移失控</span>：多轮转发对话全文易冲淡初始约束，缺乏规范与实际轨迹的实时比对</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '4px 7px', background: '#F8FBFF', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.4, color: '#1F2937', lineHeight: 1.25 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>四件套指针交接 + 三态轨迹对照</span>：交接仅传路径指针不传长文；任务板预算熔断 + 异构独立验收 + 实线/虚线/橙色对照</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 82, padding: '4px 6px', background: '#F8FAFC', borderRight: '1px solid #E5E7EB', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.0, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>5. 运行控制</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 298, padding: '4px 7px', background: '#FFFBFB', borderRight: '1px solid #E5E7EB', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.3, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.25 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9D0A12' }}>单次子进程遇审批即挂死或断连</span>：单次 CLI 进程无法在写文件前挂起等待外部批准，重跑易丢上下文</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '4px 7px', background: '#F8FBFF', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.4, color: '#1F2937', lineHeight: 1.25 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#073E87' }}>常驻会话轮内审批 + 会话库线程分叉</span>：5 个产品实测写文件前轮内挂起→网页/CLI 批准后同轮写出；Codex 支持线程分叉</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
    
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 42, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, background: 'rgba(7,62,135,0.06)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '0 14px' }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.2, color: '#073E87', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 50 }}>给人</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.2, color: '#1F2937' }}>双颗粒度 Trace 先看粗粒度决策段，再按 turn+steps 下钻细粒度步骤证据</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 22, background: '#9CA3AF' }}>
    
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.2, color: '#9D0A12', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 50 }}>给 AI</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.2, color: '#1F2937' }}>靠官方协议+CDP+适配器吃尽各家活动低价与闭源独家优化，小尺度复用宿主、大尺度中心当宿主</Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
